From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cap <cap-bot@discord.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 12:00:00 -0700
Subject: fix: pointer lock in views that only receive forwarded input

A view painted beneath another view, such as a WebContentsView whose mouse
input is relayed to it by the view above over CDP, never receives real OS
mouse events. Pointer lock depends on them in two ways, and both broke.

Unlock restores the cursor to the position the view last saw in a real
mouse event, which such a view never records, so every unlock warped the
cursor to the view's top-left corner. Record the real OS cursor position
each time a lock begins instead, so unlock returns the cursor to where that
lock started. For views that do receive real mouse events this matches the
last event position, as a lock is requested in response to one, and it
brings Aura in line with macOS, which already restores the cursor to the OS
position read at lock time.

While locked, the view keeps the hidden cursor centered and turns real
mouse input into relative movement, but only for events it receives, and
locking does not take mouse capture, so events kept going to the window
under the cursor. The cursor was never recentered, ran into the lock's
clip region or the screen edge, and movement stopped. Take mouse capture
when the lock begins, as this code did before the lock moved into
WindowTreeHost::LockMouse. Unlocking already releases capture held by the
locked window, and views that lock on a mouse press already hold capture
from that press.

diff --git a/content/browser/renderer_host/render_widget_host_view_event_handler.cc b/content/browser/renderer_host/render_widget_host_view_event_handler.cc
index 0de09e162bb4b16f84a90a29c5b70505f343ee1d..c4488847b78f629d74568daae17687b2e4b2d0d8 100644
--- a/content/browser/renderer_host/render_widget_host_view_event_handler.cc
+++ b/content/browser/renderer_host/render_widget_host_view_event_handler.cc
@@ -32,6 +32,7 @@
 #include "ui/base/ime/text_input_client.h"
 #include "ui/compositor/compositor.h"
 #include "ui/compositor/layer.h"
+#include "ui/display/screen.h"
 #include "ui/events/blink/blink_event_util.h"
 #include "ui/events/blink/web_input_event.h"
 #include "ui/events/keycodes/dom/dom_code.h"
@@ -146,10 +147,17 @@ blink::mojom::PointerLockResult RenderWidgetHostViewEventHandler::LockPointer(
     if (!mouse_locked_unadjusted_movement_)
       return blink::mojom::PointerLockResult::kUnsupportedOptions;
   }
+
+  unlocked_global_mouse_position_ =
+      gfx::PointF(display::Screen::Get()->GetCursorScreenPoint());
+  unlocked_mouse_position_ = unlocked_global_mouse_position_ -
+                             window_->GetBoundsInScreen().OffsetFromOrigin();
+
   mouse_locked_ = true;
 
   aura::Window::ScopedDeleteBlocker delete_blocker(window_);
   window_->GetHost()->LockMouse(window_);
+  window_->SetCapture();
 
   if (ShouldMoveToCenter(unlocked_global_mouse_position_))
     MoveCursorToCenter(nullptr);
